{"id":"c2784eb4c9c2da6f","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-omega-initial-segment.md","title":"Incompressibility of Omega Initial Segments","display":"thm-omega-initial-segment — Incompressibility of Omega Initial Segments","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-omega-initial-segment","aliases":["43-thm-omega-initial-segment"],"display":"thm-omega-initial-segment — Incompressibility of Omega Initial Segments","depends_on":["[[43-df-omega]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 9.2.5","source_printed_pages":"171","source_pdf_pages":"191","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-omega-initial-segment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-omega-initial-segment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-initial-segment — Incompressibility of Omega Initial Segments"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e51855b95e81cff\" href=\"?note=2e51855b95e81cff\" title=\"43-df-omega\">43-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5078ab697e20add\" href=\"?note=f5078ab697e20add\" title=\"43-df-universal-prefix-machine\">43-df-universal-prefix-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 9.2.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"171"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"191"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(U:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f5078ab697e20add\" href=\"?note=f5078ab697e20add\" title=\"43-df-universal-prefix-machine\">43-df-universal-prefix-machine</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U\">\\(\\Omega_U\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e51855b95e81cff\" href=\"?note=2e51855b95e81cff\" title=\"43-df-omega\">43-df-omega</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U=\\sum_{i=0}^{\\infty}X(i)2^{-i-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Omega_U=\\sum_{i=0}^{\\infty}X(i)2^{-i-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\upharpoonright n\">\\(X\\upharpoonright n\\)</span> 是长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的二进制前缀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n-c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n-c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把停机概率的二进制展开明确绑定为序列 X 后，前缀运算只作用于序列。数学结论仍为通用前缀机器停机概率的初段不可压缩性。</p>\n<p>书目定位沿用附件的 Theorem 9.2.5，印刷页 171、PDF 页 191；本轮核查类型和内部依赖，未重新核对未附原书 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"2e51855b95e81cff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-universal-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-universal-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}$ 满足 [[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]] 的 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$，$\\Omega_U$ 见 [[43-df-omega]]。$X\\in2^\\omega$ 满足","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"2e51855b95e81cff","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}$ 满足 [[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]] 的 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$，$\\Omega_U$ 见 [[43-df-omega]]。$X\\in2^\\omega$ 满足","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K$ 见 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]；$X\\upharpoonright n$ 是长度为 $n$ 的二进制前缀。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_U","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_U=\\sum_{i=0}^{\\infty}X(i)2^{-i-1}.","display":true},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"X\\upharpoonright n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n-c.","display":true}],"bytes":1514,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-228","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-omega-initial-segment]] — Incompressibility of Omega Initial Segments"}],"outgoing":["2e51855b95e81cff","6cd902d852c2c848","f5078ab697e20add"]}